Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='notonpath', at=datetime(2026, 9, 8, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='suzatary is not on PATH in .#triage; scripts and prompts run it through scripts/app-bin.sh', body="*`suzatary` is NOT on PATH in `.#triage`* (2026-09-08; it made every `app/` edit force a \\~30-minute release rebuild, plus `.#suzatary-fixture` and `.#suzatary-wire-ts`, before any test ran). The shell carries `.#rust`'s toolchain (`flake.nix`'s shared `rustToolchain`): `scripts/app-build.sh` builds incrementally for a dev loop (never deployed); `scripts/app-bin.sh` resolves and runs the pure `.#suzatary` derivation on demand, cached by tree — always the deployed program, in scripts (`serve-web.sh`, `.claude/mcp-suzatary.json`) and prompts: `nix develop .#triage -c scripts/app-bin.sh <verb>` replaces `nix develop .#triage -c suzatary <verb>` everywhere.", rationale='Decided 2026-09-08. Incident: with the binary on PATH, every app/ edit forced a ~30-minute release rebuild before any test ran.', supersedes=()))